{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_003mik_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_003mik_title", "source_sha256": "137b065814a3034d390dcac3f080b57c24bdfb89eb400fb5e71c6c915058c47c", "ja": "美希と舞台裏", "zh": "美希与后台", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_003mik_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_003mik_synopsis", "source_sha256": "e5390b8ea43b525366b7f365cf9c34533d8682204adfc71e266d838b8f349551", "ja": "美希との舞台裏の一幕です。", "zh": "美希在后台的一幕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_003mik_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_003mik_1000_003mik", "source_sha256": "4a20796ce21adce896ad1bf9bb9e9ac0060fe654e5e57763182822bbfa347c80", "ja": "あ、プロデューサー！　やっと会えたの～！\nねえねえ、今日こそミキのレッスン、見てくれる？", "zh": "啊，制作人！终于见到你了～！\n喂喂，今天你总该会来看美希的训练了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_003mik_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_003mik_1001_402cpr", "source_sha256": "80d21e3525483d832a2178bf2a1e22b0214faff5b6ef066c08af39e0ab306820", "ja": "あ、いや、すまん！　今日は新人のオリエンがあって。\n一応、新人教育ってヤツかな。", "zh": "啊，不好意思！今天有新人的入职培训。算是新人培训吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_003mik_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_003mik_1002_003mik", "source_sha256": "0591a7fd534d7396611818bf1780c04059e740b5e26bdf1decd4b6a0ef8b9e46", "ja": "新人……新しいプロデューサーのこと？　むー。\nハニー、最近新人さんのことばっかりでつまんないの。", "zh": "新人……是指新来的制作人？唔——\n亲爱的，你最近总是光顾着新人，真没意思。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_003mik_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_003mik_1003_402cpr", "source_sha256": "0da86bb35b343b4ae9cc6940fb4489b4521bc190aa503f7c8360c82965d5855d", "ja": "え！？　そうか……？", "zh": "诶！？是这样吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_003mik_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_003mik_1004_003mik", "source_sha256": "afa468fff935eb5e5b1df5223be3bbf23c358aa720046214f60ccc782576f129", "ja": "プロデューサーばっかり育ててないで、\nミキのこと、ちゃんと育ててって思うな。", "zh": "别光顾着培养制作人，也好好培养一下美希嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_003mik_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_003mik_1005_402cpr", "source_sha256": "48eb2592a56e8a157b2db1eecee2f7fa81c78f575cf1e3d23cb30afe529cfc77", "ja": "う……。そうだよな、ごめん。\nでも、そこは約束するよ。", "zh": "唔……你说得对，对不起。\n不过，这一点我向你保证。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_003mik_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_003mik_1006_402cpr", "source_sha256": "b587e948407e89262c45a54404f0f2e9924ae37ae50e04b2f5f114c3b95f72c0", "ja": "プロデューサーもアイドルも、新しい仲間が増えたのは\nみんなで先に進むため、今よりもっと輝くためだ。", "zh": "制作人和偶像们之所以有了新的伙伴，\n是为了大家一起向前迈进，为了比现在更加闪耀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_003mik_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_003mik_1007_402cpr", "source_sha256": "191a832a14245ca8c8602696ec18c7e1883fd5c324ee02078e7187eff108d5a8", "ja": "だから、これからもしっかりプロデュースするよ。\nみんなで一緒に、どこまでも進むためにな！", "zh": "所以，今后我也会好好为大家做好制作人的工作。\n为了和大家一起，一直前进下去！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_003mik_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_003mik_1008_003mik", "source_sha256": "e7ef57c076863ad78080a1cba277e48944ce0083b7e40f7cd98c6142f49bb27b", "ja": "……じゃあ、そのオリエン？が終わったら、\nミキのレッスン、すぐ見に来てくれる？", "zh": "……那，那个培训？结束后，\n你会马上来看美希的训练吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_003mik_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_003mik_1009_402cpr", "source_sha256": "b5c99e651ba413adb7bf25f23834cbf2fc78041d61b8f0f252f97be98b36c44c", "ja": "いいけど、結構時間かかりそうで……。\nそれでも平気か？", "zh": "是可以，但好像要花蛮长时间的……\n这样也没关系吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_003mik_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_003mik_1010_003mik", "source_sha256": "68f683772c3b21e6998c6339f02066cf778d7cd032b5f896273b2e1257d229e4", "ja": "うん！　レッスンしたり、お昼寝したりしてれば、\nあっという間なの♪　それにー。", "zh": "嗯！只要练习啊、午睡啊，\n时间一下子就过去了♪ 而且——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_003mik_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_003mik_1011_003mik", "source_sha256": "649f812e7258bb437efdd8746466e91c0394e385567dc6969183390ca7ad1ea8", "ja": "もっと先の、もっとキラキラのステージ。\nミキも見てみたいって思ったから。あはっ！", "zh": "更远方、更闪耀的舞台。\n美希也想去看一看呢。啊哈哈！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
